WEBVTT

00:00:13.304 --> 00:00:14.764
Yoko!

00:00:15.265 --> 00:00:18.143
Hey, where are you?

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.653
Uh…

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:35.910
Hey, Yoko!
You know, everyone can see your butt!

00:00:38.288 --> 00:00:41.041
Hi, Yoko! I'm glad I found you.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:43.460
Uh, could it be?

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:47.881
Lucien, it's you!

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.186
I don't believe it!

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:04.814
Lucien, is it really you?

00:01:05.899 --> 00:01:07.650
I'm so happy.

00:01:08.485 --> 00:01:12.614
You just disappeared all of a sudden
on the way back from the ninja fortress.

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:16.826
I was so worried.

00:01:18.328 --> 00:01:20.705
Miss Yoko! We heard you shouting!

00:01:20.789 --> 00:01:23.416
Is everything okay?

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.876
Uh…

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:37.388
Seriously, you can't pop out of nowhere
and scare me like that.

00:01:37.472 --> 00:01:40.141
It won't happen again, my lady.

00:01:40.225 --> 00:01:42.811
We thought you were in trouble
and ran over. Forgive us.

00:01:42.894 --> 00:01:46.106
Well, I guess you are
in charge of protecting me.

00:01:46.189 --> 00:01:48.024
So it's not like you had a choice.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:50.777
<i>Actually, Lucien saw me naked too.</i>

00:01:52.070 --> 00:01:54.572
<i>But he's acting like nothing happened.</i>

00:01:55.740 --> 00:01:58.368
<i>Anyway, it looks</i>
<i>like I've accomplished my mission.</i>

00:01:58.451 --> 00:02:00.370
<i>So, we can relax for a bit.</i>

00:02:01.037 --> 00:02:04.415
Miss Yoko?
This may be a foolish thing to ask,

00:02:04.499 --> 00:02:08.169
but is that boy right there really him?

00:02:08.253 --> 00:02:10.755
Uh-huh. This is the one and only Lucien.

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.924
He's so young, though.

00:02:13.007 --> 00:02:16.678
It's hard to imagine
he's the true form of Dark Schneider.

00:02:16.761 --> 00:02:18.763
Huh? Who's that little dragon?

00:02:18.847 --> 00:02:20.640
Mm.

00:02:20.723 --> 00:02:23.101
Hi there! You're from Gara's place.

00:02:23.184 --> 00:02:24.644
Your name is Lars, right?

00:02:26.396 --> 00:02:28.064
Ninja Master Gara?

00:02:29.149 --> 00:02:30.984
I knew all of this felt too easy.

00:02:31.067 --> 00:02:32.902
This could be a trap.
We can't trust that thing.

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:34.779
Don't jump to conclusions.

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:37.574
Gara may be a weirdo,
but he's actually not a bad guy.

00:02:37.657 --> 00:02:41.786
Besides, I don't feel some evil aura
coming from Lars.

00:02:41.870 --> 00:02:44.664
I know it sounds strange,
but my gut feeling is hardly ever wrong.

00:02:44.747 --> 00:02:46.166
So trust me on this.

00:02:46.249 --> 00:02:48.418
I suppose
we have no reason <i>not</i> to trust you.

00:02:49.961 --> 00:02:52.005
It's kinda funny that his name is Lars.

00:02:52.130 --> 00:02:54.215
That's the prince's name as well.

00:02:54.299 --> 00:02:56.634
He's Princess Sheila's
older brother, you know.

00:02:57.135 --> 00:02:58.636
Ironic name for a dragon.

00:02:58.720 --> 00:03:01.848
<i>15 years ago,</i>
<i>during the great war,</i>

00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:05.059
<i>Prince Lars Ul Meta-llicana</i>
<i>used a forbidden spell</i>

00:03:05.143 --> 00:03:07.187
<i>that would allow him</i>
<i>to defeat Dark Schneider.</i>

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:10.398
<i>The spell transformed him</i>
<i>into the legendary Dragon Knight</i>

00:03:10.481 --> 00:03:12.442
<i>that the ancient prophecies speak of.</i>

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:13.818
<i>And in that form,</i>

00:03:13.902 --> 00:03:18.323
<i>he fought alongside the four heroes,</i>
<i>including Geo, to save the four kingdoms.</i>

00:03:18.406 --> 00:03:21.492
They say the prince and Dark Schneider
killed each other at the same time.

00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:24.329
But no one can confirm the prince's death.

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:25.622
It's an amazing story.

00:03:25.705 --> 00:03:30.043
Hey. Maybe that little dragon
is the reincarnation of Prince Lars.

00:03:30.126 --> 00:03:32.170
That would be pretty hilarious!

00:03:34.505 --> 00:03:35.590
Count Di-amon.

00:03:35.673 --> 00:03:38.384
I've procured a selection of girls
from the village for you,

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:39.802
as you requested.

00:03:39.886 --> 00:03:42.555
Good.
I've been waiting for this.

00:03:42.639 --> 00:03:45.808
And I assume all the girls
you've brought here are virgins

00:03:45.892 --> 00:03:47.518
just like I ordered.

00:03:47.602 --> 00:03:49.479
Right, Jodoh?

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:52.482
Uh, that's right!
Uh, exactly as I promised.

00:03:52.565 --> 00:03:55.944
Please, uh, go ahead
and see for yourself, Count Di-amon!

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:01.199
Hmm.

00:04:02.867 --> 00:04:05.036
What do you think?
Do you like what you see?

00:04:05.119 --> 00:04:07.330
I do hope I've proven my loyalty to you,

00:04:07.413 --> 00:04:09.624
and shown
that I am someone you can rely on.

00:04:09.707 --> 00:04:14.337
Two out of the Three Sorcerer Generals
have lost to Dark Schneider.

00:04:14.420 --> 00:04:18.466
A pathetic display from those
who represent the Dark Rebel Army.

00:04:18.549 --> 00:04:23.554
However, I, the great Count Di-amon,
will not lose so easily!

00:04:23.638 --> 00:04:25.932
That's because my body is immortal!

00:04:26.015 --> 00:04:30.478
And I have acquired eternal life,
so I will outlive everyone on this planet.

00:04:30.561 --> 00:04:34.148
My magic is so powerful,
it rivals even Empress Nei's!

00:04:34.232 --> 00:04:38.027
In order to make my power
grow even stronger than it already is,

00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:40.947
I need to drink the blood
of as many young virgin maidens

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.573
as I possibly can.

00:04:42.657 --> 00:04:45.326
You understand that, don't you, Jodoh?

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.161
Uh, yes. Of course, I do.

00:04:47.245 --> 00:04:48.871
Oh, is that so?

00:04:50.123 --> 00:04:51.541
If that's the case,

00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:55.253
then I want you to explain
why this one's not a virgin!

00:04:55.336 --> 00:04:58.131
Huh?
Uh, no way! That's impossible!

00:04:58.214 --> 00:05:01.592
I'm afraid
that this won't do at all, Jodoh.

00:05:01.676 --> 00:05:05.722
I can't forgive people
who aren't able to keep their promises.

00:05:05.805 --> 00:05:09.058
You will have to be punished
for your transgressions.

00:05:10.101 --> 00:05:12.520
No. Please give me another chance.

00:05:12.603 --> 00:05:14.272
Surely there's been some kind of mistake.

00:05:14.355 --> 00:05:16.941
Hold still so I can suck your blood!

00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:27.327
That tasted terrible.

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:33.416
I'm curious as to how the others
I sent out to find virgin maidens

00:05:33.499 --> 00:05:35.418
are doing on their hunt.

00:05:35.501 --> 00:05:37.879
I can't wait for them to return.

00:05:42.091 --> 00:05:43.593
My, what a big catch.

00:05:45.428 --> 00:05:49.265
There's no doubt about it.
You three definitely smell like virgins.

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:53.019
Mm. The moon is full
and especially beautiful tonight.

00:05:53.102 --> 00:05:55.521
I can feel my blood boil!

00:06:10.203 --> 00:06:12.580
Lucien,
you should really move closer to the fire.

00:06:12.663 --> 00:06:14.123
You're going to catch a cold.

00:06:18.378 --> 00:06:21.756
<i>This evil aura, where is it coming from?</i>

00:06:22.256 --> 00:06:23.549
Hey! Get up!

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.059
Who do we have here?

00:06:34.310 --> 00:06:35.395
What is that thing?

00:06:35.478 --> 00:06:37.397
It's, it's a werewolf?

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:39.607
I thought I smelled a virgin!

00:06:39.690 --> 00:06:41.317
And she's prime stuff too.

00:06:41.401 --> 00:06:43.319
What an amazing aroma.

00:06:43.403 --> 00:06:45.071
Hurry! Protect Miss Tia!

00:06:45.154 --> 00:06:47.281
Get out of my way!

00:06:51.661 --> 00:06:53.788
You're too good to hand over to the Count.

00:06:53.871 --> 00:06:55.957
You're all mine!

00:06:59.627 --> 00:07:01.587
-Hey, you!
-Huh?

00:07:02.713 --> 00:07:06.676
Don't you dare touch Yoko
with those filthy ass hands of yours!

00:07:06.759 --> 00:07:09.137
Who the hell do you think you are,
you little punk?

00:07:09.637 --> 00:07:12.348
If you try to lay even one finger on her,

00:07:12.432 --> 00:07:14.517
then I'm gonna kill you!

00:07:14.600 --> 00:07:17.228
Wait a sec. That voice isn't Lucien's.

00:07:19.021 --> 00:07:21.399
You kill me? Have you lost your mind?

00:07:21.482 --> 00:07:24.193
I'm gonna crush you to death
before you can even blink

00:07:24.277 --> 00:07:27.155
Stop talking so I don't have
to smell your dog breath.

00:07:27.238 --> 00:07:28.114
What did you say?

00:07:28.197 --> 00:07:31.868
Just get the hell out of my sight already,
you stupid, smelly, mutt!

00:07:34.954 --> 00:07:36.414
What is this aura?

00:07:36.497 --> 00:07:37.540
You rotten kid!

00:07:37.623 --> 00:07:39.625
There's no way you're an ordinary human.

00:07:40.251 --> 00:07:41.752
Not this, again.

00:07:41.836 --> 00:07:44.213
The same thing happened
the night I got kidnapped.

00:07:45.381 --> 00:07:47.675
<i>The transition is evolving.</i>

00:07:48.301 --> 00:07:49.302
Why?

00:07:50.303 --> 00:07:53.139
Tell me, punk.
Are some kind of wizard?

00:07:53.222 --> 00:07:54.557
You idiotic beast.

00:07:54.640 --> 00:07:58.060
You have the audacity
to bear your fangs against a human?

00:07:58.144 --> 00:08:02.273
Stay right where you are because
I'm going to turn you into mincemeat.

00:08:02.356 --> 00:08:04.942
D-did you just call me a beast?

00:08:05.026 --> 00:08:06.277
You little shithead.

00:08:06.360 --> 00:08:09.322
You're the one
who's gonna get turned into mincemeat!

00:08:10.364 --> 00:08:12.116
Wolf Fang Thunder Fist!

00:08:12.200 --> 00:08:14.285
Stop!

00:08:14.368 --> 00:08:16.329
How's this, you stupid brat?

00:08:16.412 --> 00:08:18.331
Who cares if you're a wizard?

00:08:18.414 --> 00:08:20.500
If I stop you
before you can finish your spell,

00:08:20.583 --> 00:08:22.251
then you're powerless against me.

00:08:22.335 --> 00:08:25.588
I'm a skilled martial artist
in my human form!

00:08:25.671 --> 00:08:28.674
A frail wizard like you is no match for me

00:08:28.758 --> 00:08:31.219
when I've transformed into a werewolf!

00:08:32.094 --> 00:08:33.262
No more games.

00:08:33.346 --> 00:08:37.183
You're gonna suffer a painful death
for the things you called me!

00:08:38.434 --> 00:08:39.769
<i>He's gonna die!</i>

00:08:39.852 --> 00:08:43.022
<i>He has Dark Schneider's spirit,</i>
<i>but his body is still Lucien's!</i>

00:08:43.105 --> 00:08:44.273
Say goodbye!

00:08:44.357 --> 00:08:47.151
It's time to end this once and for all!

00:08:53.241 --> 00:08:55.326
You're just some puny little bit player.

00:08:55.409 --> 00:08:57.703
You got no business
taking up so much screen time.

00:08:57.787 --> 00:09:00.206
You're gonna confuse the people watching
by doing that,

00:09:00.289 --> 00:09:02.625
so you'd better apologize
to them right now.

00:09:03.417 --> 00:09:07.046
<i>No way. That kid</i>
<i>really is Dark Schneider on the inside!</i>

00:09:07.129 --> 00:09:09.507
<i>This is insane. What's going on here?</i>

00:09:10.883 --> 00:09:12.593
He's got so much power.

00:09:12.677 --> 00:09:15.137
You're more
than a mere wizard, aren't you?

00:09:15.221 --> 00:09:18.224
Hmm? What was that?
You say you want to see a magic trick?

00:09:18.307 --> 00:09:19.934
No, I…

00:09:21.644 --> 00:09:24.438
Then I'll do a special one just for you.

00:09:24.522 --> 00:09:25.898
Wait. Please, no.

00:09:25.982 --> 00:09:29.610
Zaazard, Zaazard.
Schrono, Chronossk.

00:09:29.694 --> 00:09:31.320
That spell he's using…

00:09:31.404 --> 00:09:34.907
Oh, flames of hell,
burning in the depths of darkness…

00:09:34.991 --> 00:09:38.327
You can't be Dark Schneider!
You… you can't be!

00:09:38.411 --> 00:09:41.163
Be my sword and slay my enemies before me!

00:09:42.373 --> 00:09:43.624
Venom!

00:09:46.877 --> 00:09:48.421
You managed to live?

00:09:49.589 --> 00:09:51.757
Wow!
That's pretty incredible of you, wolfman.

00:09:51.841 --> 00:09:54.969
You've got a lot of spunk.
Guess you're cooler than I thought.

00:09:56.554 --> 00:09:58.723
So this must be the power of magic.

00:09:58.806 --> 00:10:01.017
It hurts! It hurts! It hurts!

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.184
Shut up!

00:10:03.311 --> 00:10:06.856
Now then, tell me if you want me
to kill you slowly or quickly.

00:10:06.939 --> 00:10:10.901
Stop torturing me! I can't take it!

00:10:10.985 --> 00:10:13.696
-Count! Please save me. I don't wanna die.
-Huh?

00:10:13.779 --> 00:10:16.866
Oh, I see. So it was the Count
who sent you here, was it?

00:10:16.949 --> 00:10:20.870
If I'm not mistaken, he's the guy
who has werewolves working for him

00:10:20.953 --> 00:10:25.833
to find virgins from local villages,
and he's a vampire, right?

00:10:25.916 --> 00:10:27.585
Did he say vampire?

00:10:27.668 --> 00:10:29.629
But I'm curious about something.

00:10:29.712 --> 00:10:31.130
In terms of undead,

00:10:31.213 --> 00:10:34.383
it's said Vampires are one
of the strongest creatures among them.

00:10:34.467 --> 00:10:37.053
According to what Kai Harn
told me about the Count,

00:10:37.637 --> 00:10:41.432
he was able to turn himself
into a vampire using his own magic.

00:10:41.515 --> 00:10:43.517
That must mean he's a trueblood, right?

00:10:43.601 --> 00:10:45.853
Why is a guy as powerful as he is

00:10:45.936 --> 00:10:49.482
even bothering to work
under someone like Arshes, huh?

00:10:50.149 --> 00:10:52.526
<i> Kai Harn? Arshes?</i>

00:10:53.027 --> 00:10:54.153
Hmm.

00:10:54.779 --> 00:10:56.697
I'm gonna take a wild guess

00:10:56.781 --> 00:10:59.950
and say the reason why the Count
needs the blood of virgin girls

00:11:00.034 --> 00:11:03.079
is because he wants
to try and overthrow Arshes and Kall-Su.

00:11:03.871 --> 00:11:04.872
Is that right?

00:11:05.373 --> 00:11:08.709
I'm gonna kill you if you don't tell me.

00:11:09.251 --> 00:11:11.587
Okay! I-I'll do it!

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:13.422
Don't kill me. Please!

00:11:13.506 --> 00:11:16.676
Well, I guess I don't have to.

00:11:17.343 --> 00:11:18.386
But you better talk.

00:11:18.469 --> 00:11:20.012
Okay. It's…

00:11:20.805 --> 00:11:21.806
it's true.

00:11:21.889 --> 00:11:24.100
Please, let me g--

00:11:26.769 --> 00:11:28.521
A vampire, huh?

00:11:28.604 --> 00:11:31.148
This is definitely gonna get messy.

00:11:31.232 --> 00:11:33.401
Hey! Lucien!

00:11:33.484 --> 00:11:36.529
I know that guy was the enemy,
but that was just cruel.

00:11:36.612 --> 00:11:39.031
-And another thing--
-Would you shut the hell up already, Yoko?

00:11:39.115 --> 00:11:41.701
We haven't seen each other
in a while, and you're already starting--

00:11:41.784 --> 00:11:43.536
I wanna know why you suddenly disappeared

00:11:43.619 --> 00:11:45.621
while we were heading back
from the ninja fortress.

00:11:46.205 --> 00:11:47.915
What have you been up to this whole time?

00:11:47.998 --> 00:11:49.583
Why did you turn back into Lucien?

00:11:49.667 --> 00:11:52.336
Answer me!
Or else I'm never speaking to you again.

00:11:58.134 --> 00:12:01.095
-Okay. Tell me this.
-I'm listening.

00:12:01.178 --> 00:12:04.473
You mentioned Kai Harn
and Arshes earlier.

00:12:04.557 --> 00:12:06.434
Just who exactly are they?

00:12:07.017 --> 00:12:10.646
You better tell me, or I won't
tell you bedtime stories anymore.

00:12:12.148 --> 00:12:13.774
Oh, come on!

00:12:13.858 --> 00:12:16.986
You're such a sweet and innocent boy
when you're Lucien.

00:12:17.069 --> 00:12:19.697
Why do you always have
to act like this after the seal breaks?

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:24.452
<i>So, basically, Dark Schneider</i>
<i>hasn't been completely resurrected.</i>

00:12:24.535 --> 00:12:25.703
<i>And instead…</i>

00:12:26.203 --> 00:12:30.499
He has been sealed away deep
inside of that young boy named Lucien,

00:12:30.583 --> 00:12:33.794
and can't come out
unless the conditions have been met.

00:12:35.004 --> 00:12:38.257
This is becoming very interesting.

00:12:41.260 --> 00:12:45.473
<i>There is a legendary wizard</i>
<i>still feared by many to this day,</i>

00:12:45.556 --> 00:12:48.517
<i>who once commanded</i>
<i>a huge army of darkness.</i>

00:12:48.601 --> 00:12:50.770
<i>His name is Dark Schneider.</i>

00:12:50.853 --> 00:12:54.482
<i>Fifteen years ago,</i>
<i>he waged war against the four kingdoms</i>

00:12:54.565 --> 00:12:56.692
<i>with his four disciples in tow.</i>

00:12:56.776 --> 00:12:59.361
<i>No one has ever been able</i>
<i>to stand up to him.</i>

00:12:59.445 --> 00:13:00.946
<i>He's unrivaled in power.</i>

00:13:01.822 --> 00:13:04.033
<i>His magic terrorized the lands.</i>

00:13:04.116 --> 00:13:07.286
<i>It was so powerful,</i>
<i>he could even change the weather.</i>

00:13:07.369 --> 00:13:10.164
<i>He was a wizard</i>
<i>with the physique of a warrior.</i>

00:13:10.247 --> 00:13:12.541
<i>He's been reincarnated many times,</i>

00:13:12.625 --> 00:13:15.669
<i>and upon being reborn,</i>
<i>his magic grew in power</i>

00:13:15.753 --> 00:13:17.671
<i>as he cast away his old body.</i>

00:13:17.755 --> 00:13:20.466
<i>That's how he became</i>
<i>as powerful as he is today.</i>

00:13:21.050 --> 00:13:23.511
<i>Ordinarily, I would be no match</i>

00:13:23.594 --> 00:13:27.223
<i>for someone as mighty</i>
<i>as the legendary wizard, Dark Schneider.</i>

00:13:27.306 --> 00:13:30.267
However,
now that it's become quite clear to me

00:13:30.351 --> 00:13:32.478
his resurrection
hasn't been completed yet,

00:13:32.561 --> 00:13:36.524
That means, I still have a chance
of overpowering him!

00:13:36.607 --> 00:13:38.484
Isn't that right, Jodoh?

00:13:38.567 --> 00:13:41.028
Yes, of course, Count.

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:43.656
Whoo!

00:13:44.156 --> 00:13:47.660
No one's as magnificent,
or nearly as brilliant,

00:13:47.743 --> 00:13:49.745
or as gorgeous as me.

00:13:52.122 --> 00:13:55.084
I am one of the Three Sorcerer Generals,

00:13:55.167 --> 00:13:57.419
and the most powerful count on earth.

00:13:57.503 --> 00:13:59.839
People tremble at hearing my name.

00:13:59.922 --> 00:14:01.507
And that name is Di-amon.

00:14:01.590 --> 00:14:04.593
Isn't everything that I said right, Jodoh?

00:14:04.677 --> 00:14:06.011
Uh, yes. It is.

00:14:06.595 --> 00:14:08.722
-Who the hell is that?
-Is he a phantom?

00:14:08.806 --> 00:14:11.809
Give me a break!
We just beat the other guy.

00:14:11.892 --> 00:14:15.563
Oh no. The shock of all this
must be causing Lucien to break through.

00:14:15.646 --> 00:14:17.064
Huh? Wait. What did you say?

00:14:17.147 --> 00:14:19.024
No. Wait. Not now, you dumbass!

00:14:23.362 --> 00:14:24.655
Mm.

00:14:24.738 --> 00:14:25.990
Hmm?

00:14:27.324 --> 00:14:28.617
Is it Halloween?

00:14:28.701 --> 00:14:30.911
I see. So that's how it works.

00:14:30.995 --> 00:14:34.623
Dark Schneider can only exist
while Lucien is in deep slumber.

00:14:34.707 --> 00:14:38.127
Otherwise, it appears the boy
has full control over his own body.

00:14:38.752 --> 00:14:40.421
Go capture that boy!

00:14:42.006 --> 00:14:45.134
No! Yoko, help me!

00:14:47.219 --> 00:14:48.846
Please let me out of here!

00:14:48.929 --> 00:14:53.976
Seriously? You're so unreliable
in situations where it really matters.

00:14:54.059 --> 00:14:56.520
I'm so scared!

00:14:56.604 --> 00:14:58.939
Who would have thought
it would be so incredibly easy

00:14:59.023 --> 00:15:02.276
to capture
the great legendary wizard Dark Schneider.

00:15:02.359 --> 00:15:04.486
And not only did I accomplish that,

00:15:04.570 --> 00:15:07.656
but I even managed to acquire
three beautiful virgins as well.

00:15:08.240 --> 00:15:09.867
<i>Huh? Three?</i>

00:15:11.201 --> 00:15:14.246
I, the great and marvelous Count Di-amon,

00:15:14.330 --> 00:15:15.956
am victorious!

00:15:16.040 --> 00:15:18.584
'Tis truly a night
to celebrate my success!

00:15:20.502 --> 00:15:22.588
Well, isn't that right, Jodoh?

00:15:22.671 --> 00:15:25.007
Sure is.

00:15:25.090 --> 00:15:27.134
Wait. Are they who I think they are?

00:15:27.217 --> 00:15:29.219
Hurry up and move, you traitors!

00:15:29.303 --> 00:15:31.221
The Count is waiting for you.

00:15:31.305 --> 00:15:33.933
I thank you
for joining me in my humble abode,

00:15:34.016 --> 00:15:36.435
my fellow Sorcerer Generals.

00:15:36.518 --> 00:15:39.063
Sean Ari and Kai Harn.

00:15:40.314 --> 00:15:44.944
I'm quite disappointed with the results
of your fight against Dark Schneider.

00:15:45.027 --> 00:15:46.737
You should have fought to your death

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:50.449
instead of wagging your tails like
good little dogs and begging for mercy.

00:15:50.532 --> 00:15:53.827
I see you two as traitors
and not as comrades now.

00:15:53.911 --> 00:15:56.622
Capturing these two was no easy feat,

00:15:56.705 --> 00:15:59.166
but everything clearly worked out
in our favor.

00:15:59.249 --> 00:16:00.125
Hmm.

00:16:00.209 --> 00:16:05.130
Nice to see you actually did
a good job for once, Jodoh.

00:16:06.048 --> 00:16:08.801
You've both grown
to be such beautiful woman.

00:16:08.884 --> 00:16:10.010
Just a few years back,

00:16:10.094 --> 00:16:12.930
you were still little girls
who stank of their mother's milk.

00:16:13.013 --> 00:16:16.266
And I see
you've grown to be a monster.

00:16:16.350 --> 00:16:19.144
Just a few years back,
you used to be a decent human.

00:16:20.938 --> 00:16:24.233
Oh, your tongue
is still sharp as ever, Kai Harn.

00:16:25.275 --> 00:16:26.527
Very well.

00:16:26.610 --> 00:16:28.904
I've decided
that I will take the responsibility

00:16:28.988 --> 00:16:30.864
of executing the traitors, myself.

00:16:30.948 --> 00:16:32.491
Shut up, you monster!

00:16:32.574 --> 00:16:36.036
How can you call us that
when it's you who's the real traitor.

00:16:36.120 --> 00:16:37.246
What the…?

00:16:37.329 --> 00:16:41.041
Do you really think your pathetic lackey
can capture the two of us?

00:16:41.125 --> 00:16:42.459
How did you…?

00:16:42.543 --> 00:16:45.921
We only pretended to get caught
so he'd take us to you!

00:16:47.840 --> 00:16:49.341
Jodoh!

00:16:50.009 --> 00:16:53.137
You know what happens
to failures, don't you?

00:16:54.471 --> 00:16:55.931
No. Please forgive me, Count.

00:16:56.015 --> 00:16:57.850
I don't want to lose any more blood.

00:16:57.933 --> 00:17:00.310
Have mercy.
It won't happen again, I promise.

00:17:00.894 --> 00:17:03.731
But, please don't suck my blood!
I'll die if you do.

00:17:03.814 --> 00:17:05.024
Oh well.

00:17:09.194 --> 00:17:11.530
Someone help me!

00:17:12.114 --> 00:17:13.323
<i>Ew.</i>

00:17:13.407 --> 00:17:15.993
<i>That guy really is a vampire.</i>

00:17:19.705 --> 00:17:21.248
Delish.

00:17:21.331 --> 00:17:24.710
But not nearly as good
as your exquisite blood will be.

00:17:24.793 --> 00:17:28.589
And once I have it, it will make my magic
grow even more powerful.

00:17:28.672 --> 00:17:30.049
I'll be unstoppable!

00:17:30.132 --> 00:17:32.551
Even stronger
than Empress Nei and Lord Kall-Su.

00:17:32.634 --> 00:17:35.512
You monster!
You won't get anywhere near my blood.

00:17:35.596 --> 00:17:37.097
Come at me, Di-amon!

00:17:37.181 --> 00:17:39.183
Secret Talisman Magic!

00:17:39.266 --> 00:17:40.809
Rasho Red Hot Waltz!

00:17:42.019 --> 00:17:43.812
Secret Hariken Sword Style!

00:17:43.896 --> 00:17:45.773
Dragon Blast Demon Slash!

00:17:49.568 --> 00:17:50.569
We did it, Kai!

00:17:50.652 --> 00:17:52.446
Even a vampire couldn't withstand that.

00:17:52.529 --> 00:17:54.531
He's not so strong after all.

00:17:54.615 --> 00:17:55.616
Huh?

00:17:56.408 --> 00:17:57.785
W-what's happening?

00:17:59.578 --> 00:18:02.831
All the wounds on his body
are healing so quickly.

00:18:04.041 --> 00:18:06.502
But he was fully covered in flames!

00:18:06.585 --> 00:18:08.420
How does he not have a single burn?

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:12.216
It'll take more than that!

00:18:12.299 --> 00:18:15.135
You're both so beautiful, yet so ignorant.

00:18:15.219 --> 00:18:19.139
Did you really not know
that vampires are practically immortal?

00:18:19.223 --> 00:18:21.100
Now, come on. Don't resist.

00:18:21.183 --> 00:18:22.726
Come a little closer.

00:18:22.810 --> 00:18:25.187
Allow me to suck
all of the blood out of you.

00:18:26.021 --> 00:18:27.731
I was hoping
it wouldn't come down to this,

00:18:27.815 --> 00:18:29.316
but things aren't looking good.

00:18:29.399 --> 00:18:30.400
There's no other option.

00:18:30.484 --> 00:18:32.861
Hey, Di-amon! I got something for you.

00:18:34.279 --> 00:18:35.823
Oh no!

00:18:35.906 --> 00:18:38.617
It can't be.
You have garlic and a cross?

00:18:38.700 --> 00:18:40.869
Not those two things!

00:18:40.953 --> 00:18:43.122
They're a vampire's weakness.

00:18:43.205 --> 00:18:45.707
How could you do this to me?

00:18:46.667 --> 00:18:49.086
Foolish, foolish, foolish.

00:18:49.169 --> 00:18:52.047
Such stupid things won't work on me!

00:18:52.131 --> 00:18:54.007
No way! That should've worked!

00:18:54.091 --> 00:18:56.552
Lucien, please. You have to help her.

00:18:56.635 --> 00:18:58.554
He's gonna kill her if you don't!

00:19:02.808 --> 00:19:03.725
Kai!

00:19:06.353 --> 00:19:10.941
This is so good!
This is the taste I was looking for!

00:19:11.024 --> 00:19:12.401
This texture!

00:19:12.484 --> 00:19:16.613
So thick, and creamy, and sweet,
with a subtle aroma!

00:19:16.697 --> 00:19:20.033
Whoa. Your blood
is so much better than Jodoh's.

00:19:20.117 --> 00:19:24.204
I could drink this all day
for the rest of my immortal life!

00:19:25.747 --> 00:19:27.291
Get your hands off her!

00:19:28.417 --> 00:19:30.669
Don't worry. I'll suck you next!

00:19:30.752 --> 00:19:34.047
So just wait your turn
like a good little girl, Sean Ari!

00:19:36.049 --> 00:19:38.302
Your blood
is gonna make me more powerful

00:19:38.385 --> 00:19:41.555
than Empress Nei
and Lord Kall-Su ever were!

00:19:41.638 --> 00:19:44.016
No one will be able to stop me!

00:19:45.517 --> 00:19:46.560
You are crazy

00:19:46.643 --> 00:19:49.521
Are you doing all of this
just so you could betray Empress Nei?

00:19:51.690 --> 00:19:55.694
The world is ruled by those
who are strong enough to reach the top.

00:19:55.777 --> 00:19:59.489
This has always been
the natural order of society.

00:19:59.573 --> 00:20:03.285
The weak cannot rule over those
who are more powerful than them.

00:20:03.368 --> 00:20:06.830
Empress Nei and Lord Kall-Su
are no exception to that.

00:20:06.914 --> 00:20:11.001
Once my power exceeds theirs,
I will finally put them in their place!

00:20:11.084 --> 00:20:12.920
And I will show the world my power!

00:20:13.921 --> 00:20:16.465
Enjoy your fantasies while you still can.

00:20:16.548 --> 00:20:18.592
This won't end how you think it will.

00:20:18.675 --> 00:20:20.636
How dare you call them fantasies.

00:20:24.223 --> 00:20:26.683
Regardless of how strong your magic gets,

00:20:26.767 --> 00:20:29.937
your power will never be enough
to win against Dark Schneider.

00:20:30.020 --> 00:20:31.063
Exactly!

00:20:31.146 --> 00:20:34.858
Dark Schneider said Empress Nei and
the other Divine Kings are his friends!

00:20:34.942 --> 00:20:37.277
I know he would help them out,
no matter what.

00:20:37.361 --> 00:20:40.405
He's not going to have any problem
defeating the likes of you.

00:20:40.489 --> 00:20:42.324
And he'll do it all for Empress Nei!

00:20:43.951 --> 00:20:46.286
<i>I wish he were here right now.</i>

00:20:46.370 --> 00:20:49.623
<i>What are they talking about?</i>
<i>Who are these two?</i>

00:20:52.709 --> 00:20:54.544
You have no idea, do you?

00:20:54.628 --> 00:20:57.756
Your one last hope
has been here the whole time!

00:20:57.839 --> 00:20:59.091
-Look up.
-Huh?

00:20:59.174 --> 00:21:03.053
There's your so-called savior
trapped in that cage as my prisoner.

00:21:03.136 --> 00:21:06.098
What the…?
What are you going on about this--

00:21:06.598 --> 00:21:09.101
Foolish, foolish, foolish, foolish!

00:21:09.184 --> 00:21:10.310
So ignorant!

00:21:10.894 --> 00:21:13.480
Dark Schneider
will never be enough to stop me.

00:21:13.563 --> 00:21:16.233
You see, his reincarnation is incomplete.

00:21:16.316 --> 00:21:19.736
That infamous sorcerer is up there
sealed within that boy.

00:21:19.820 --> 00:21:20.696
Wait. What?

00:21:20.779 --> 00:21:23.407
That's… that's impossible.

00:21:23.490 --> 00:21:26.743
<i>When Lucien's awake,</i>
<i>Dark Schneider is sealed away.</i>

00:21:26.827 --> 00:21:30.163
<i>What am I supposed to do</i>
<i>in a situation where I can't reach him?</i>

00:21:30.747 --> 00:21:33.292
<i>Without the spell</i>
<i>and a virgin maiden's kiss,</i>

00:21:33.375 --> 00:21:35.168
<i>I won't be able to break the seal!</i>

00:21:35.711 --> 00:21:39.715
<i>Oh, I get it!</i>
<i>Everything's starting to make sense now!</i>

00:21:40.215 --> 00:21:43.760
<i>After the war,</i>
<i>Geo Noto Soto foresaw the future,</i>

00:21:43.844 --> 00:21:45.971
<i>and knew Dark Schneider would re-awaken.</i>

00:21:46.054 --> 00:21:48.181
<i>Geo eventually found Lucien,</i>

00:21:48.265 --> 00:21:51.101
<i>the baby</i>
<i>who Dark Schneider reincarnated into,</i>

00:21:51.184 --> 00:21:53.395
<i>and sealed</i>
<i>his spirit and power inside him!</i>

00:21:53.979 --> 00:21:56.940
<i>The legendary wizard</i>
<i>was supposed to awaken once more,</i>

00:21:57.024 --> 00:22:01.361
<i>but because of the spell, he was forced</i>
<i>to grow up in the form of Lucien Renlen.</i>

00:22:01.945 --> 00:22:04.573
<i>So, if I'm understanding this correctly,</i>

00:22:04.656 --> 00:22:07.868
<i>this means that Lucien Renlen</i>
<i>and Dark Schneider</i>

00:22:07.951 --> 00:22:11.913
<i>are two separate identities that can exist</i>
<i>within a single body and soul.</i>

00:22:11.997 --> 00:22:14.750
<i>Wait a minute. And that also means…</i>
